---
description: Prepare one constructPortfolios evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: ProposalFeasibility[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Enumerate feasible combinations under exact budget and dependency constraints, accounting for shared work and mutually exclusive uses. Present alternatives for deliberation without autonomously choosing political priorities or inferring participant preferences from personal data. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
